= Heinrich Brauns

Brauns is a member of the Reichstag and has served as labor minister for 8 years under various goverments. He is a proponent of having employers and workers negotiate on equal footing. Despite this, he remains in the party's right wing, supporting the formation of a interdenominational Christian party. He's likely to be useful in negotiations with the DNVP.

- @dnvp_relations
- @welfare
- @cvp_negotiations
