@cvp_negotiations
title: Begin negotiations for an interdenominational Christian party
subtitle: The time is now!
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and interconfessionalism = 1 and dnvp_ideology == "Moderate" and z_ideology == "Right" and (z_leader == "Stegerwald" or z_leader == "Adenauer") and dnvp_relation >= 70 and (dnvp_votes < 10 or in_center_right_coalition)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if interconfessionalism != 1: The party is commited to confessionalism. ?][? if z_ideology != "Right": Our leadership isn't willing to entertain the idea.?][? if dnvp_ideology != "Moderate": The [? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> ?][? if dnvp_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNVP**</span> ?] isn't willing to entertain the idea. ?][? if dnvp_relation < 70: We don't have adequate relations with the [? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> ?][? if dnvp_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNVP**</span> ?].?][? if not (dnvp_votes < 10 or in_center_right_coalition): The [? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> ?][? if dnvp_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNVP**</span> ?] isn't desperate enough to approve the merger, they must either suffer a huge electoral defeat or enter a national coalition with us. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: cvp_formation
